{"access_count":{"sum":2754},"additional_resources":false,"breadcrumb_text":"Adolph, C. et al.","coordinator":1043,"data_tables":[{"data":{"csv":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 1/csv","json":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 1/json","root":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 1/root","yaml":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 1/yaml","yoda":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 1/yoda","yoda.h5":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 1/yoda.h5","yoda1":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 1/yoda1"},"description":"Multiplicities of positively charged kaons from semi-inclusive deep-inelastic scattering of muons off an isoscalar target, $M^{K^{+}}$, in bins of $x$,...","doi":"10.17182/hepdata.77892.v1/t1","id":88671,"location":"","messages":true,"name":"Table 1","processed_name":"Table1","resources":[]},{"data":{"csv":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 2/csv","json":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 2/json","root":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 2/root","yaml":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 2/yaml","yoda":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 2/yoda","yoda.h5":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 2/yoda.h5","yoda1":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/table/ins1483098/Table 2/yoda1"},"description":"Multiplicities of negatively charged kaons from semi-inclusive deep-inelastic scattering of muons off an isoscalar target, $M^{K^{-}}$, in bins of $x$,...","doi":"10.17182/hepdata.77892.v1/t2","id":88672,"location":"","messages":true,"name":"Table 2","processed_name":"Table2","resources":[]}],"mode":"record","overall_status":"finished","participant_count":2,"recid":77892,"record":{"abstract":"Precise measurements of charged-kaon multiplicities in deep inelastic scattering were performed. The results are presented in three-dimensional bins of the Bjorken scaling variable x, the relative virtual-photon energy y, and the fraction z of the virtual-photon energy carried by the produced hadron. The data were obtained by the COMPASS Collaboration by scattering 160 GeV muons off an isoscalar 6 LiD target. They cover the kinematic domain 1 (GeV/c)2 < Q2 < 60 (GeV/c)^2 in the photon virtuality, 0.004 < x < 0.4, 0.1 < y < 0.7, 0.20 < z < 0.85, and W > 5 GeV/c^2 in the invariant mass of the hadronic system. The results from the sum of the z-integrated K+ and K- multiplicities at high x point to a value of the non-strange quark fragmentation function larger than obtained by the earlier DSS fit.","access_urls":{"links":{"csv":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/submission/ins1483098/1/csv","json":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/submission/ins1483098/1/json","root":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/submission/ins1483098/1/root","yaml":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/submission/ins1483098/1/yaml","yoda":"https://www.hepdata.net/download/submission/ins1483098/1/yoda"}},"analyses":[],"arxiv_id":"arXiv:1608.06760","collaborations":["COMPASS"],"control_number":"77892","creation_date":"2016-08-24","data_abstract":"Multiplicities of charged kaons produced in semi-inclusive deep-inelastic scattering were measured in bins of the Bjorken scaling variable $x$, the relative virtual-photon energy $y$ and the relative hadron energy $z$. Data were obtained by the COMPASS Collaboration using a $160$ GeV muon beam and an isoscalar target ($^{6}$LiD). They cover the kinematic domain in the photon virtuality $Q^{2}$ $&gt;$ $1$ (GeV/$c$)$^{2}$, $0.004 &lt; x &lt; 0.4$, $0.2 &lt; z &lt; 0.85$ and $0.1 &lt; y &lt; 0.7$.","data_keywords":{"cmenergies":[],"observables":["MULT"],"reactions":["$\\mu^{+}$ d--> $\\mu^{+}$ $K^{+}$ X","$\\mu^{+}$d-->\\mu^{+}$K^{-}$X"]},"doc_type":"publication","doi":"10.1016/j.physletb.2017.01.053","first_author":{"affiliation":"Erlangen - Nuremberg U.","full_name":"Adolp